th=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtblxr5mZvUKNQ4S6uCPGVhsInkok9Vh-wlRmON8RCf5MFdPuTCpSjwcYEF0vbOmDMQLWf76RH6jhRRPsnUdNb6ZoOc6M-AZ4_-tlO5qB_EWLmk6RuXSgR_Cjz02DTSYNZxENIFQqZ1BNCb0CWMmJ9ppNNDtm0_s9RwhTUbUzAHthbUYKDi8SumDDEFXN7=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhkBcxwO8v-X0nZFmZDF-IW7AY7LU8uyUpQhQGj_sW5XARB12eA0UIhDnE3tQE__PlHFPytYtJQn7O4T0bBdikKYmylloWuDlbXG-TeruBma4Pl-FwizAbQPKrMBAH1p5nHQQ36CkDPBjIJCh8co-E2B3bEXGrjxTjuAMSTmSoVqM05jw-53V2okaBmyfVM\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhkBcxwO8v-X0nZFmZDF-IW7AY7LU8uyUpQhQGj_sW5XARB12eA0UIhDnE3tQE__PlHFPytYtJQn7O4T0bBdikKYmylloWuDlbXG-TeruBma4Pl-FwizAbQPKrMBAH1p5nHQQ36CkDPBjIJCh8co-E2B3bEXGrjxTjuAMSTmSoVqM05jw-53V2okaBmyfVM=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Uì屏東坐火車來新左營盤車，坐高鐵往台北，一下到位，看時鐘離我beh坐ê hit幫車，koh ài等半點外鐘。行李拖--leh，先kā車單long入去驗票空，hua̍h過tsa̍h仔門，踮候車室揣一个位坐--落-來，有冷氣thang吹。今仔日拜一，椅仔位lóng無啥人，驚一个人坐tsia秋凊秋凊，siunn心爽m̄拄好ē tuh-ku睏--去，兩蕊目睭king開開，四箍圍仔bóng siòng。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">正爿làng我兩个位hia，坐一个看--起-來kah阮查某囝差不多年歲ê查某囡仔，手--裡抱幼嬰仔。伊ê身軀邊，徛一个量約十歲跤兜ê查埔囡仔，一雙手huānn踮行李，看--起-來拍算是伊ê後生。我自家己tshuā三个囝到tann，tsiânn久m̄ bat抱過tsiah幼ê紅嬰仔--ah，孫仔輩ê新婦若生囝做月內，ē忌剋我tsit个siùnn虎ê姑婆探頭，我kan-ta ē包一下仔紅包kā祝福niā-niā。Lán家己mā認份，m̄敢去nǹg人ê月內房。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">拄想講嬰仔iáu紅紅幼幼，哪ē抱出來tsit-lō公共場所？一時hònn玄，目睭偷偷仔siam tuì伊手--裡抱ê嬰仔，嬰仔ê媽媽智覺--著，攑頭掠我微微仔笑，tàm頭kā我招呼。嬰仔用一領tah被仔kā身軀包ba̍t-ba̍t，kan-ta ē-tàng看著一phō烏sìm-sìm ê頭毛，紅gê仔紅gê ê面模仔，睏kah綿綿，一雙幼mī-mī ê手，輕輕仔gīm-tiâu--leh。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">無一tiap仔久，看伊ê身軀khuann-khuann仔teh伸勻，目頭kat--起-來。媽媽緊kā嬰仔ânn倚蹛胸前，用倒手後khiau，thánn踮嬰仔ê後枕，正手輕輕仔搭嬰仔kha-tsiah，頭越--過-來kā我講：「食奶ê時間到，teh iau肚--ah！」看pān勢伊無飼母奶ê款。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我問：「嬰仔幾個月--ah？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">伊講：「Loh-tso̍h--日tsiah滿月，tńg來外家做月內，tsit-má beh tńg去台北。無意中有--ê，làng 10年，是查某囝。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Uì伊ê面容，ē-tàng看出一種滿足幸福ê感覺，徛tī伊邊--a ê hit个查埔囡仔，恬恬聽阮開講。Tsit个時tsūn，遠遠行來一个40 thóng歲ê查埔人，雙手mooh一支牛奶矸仔，ná行ná lián。來到tè，kā牛奶矸仔tu hōo tsit个媽媽ê手，媽媽kā牛奶矸仔接過手，講：「Iáu siunn燒--lah！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit个爸爸隨koh kā牛奶矸仔接--tńg-去，koh用手中心ná lián牛奶矸仔ná挲，講：「我ù--起-來感覺bē燒--啊！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我ke-pô神一時夯--起-來，kā in講：「Lín用手中心摸bē準--lah。」我緊kā我倒手ê手肚píng過--來，想著以早我生頭tsiūnn仔ê時，阮阿母教--我ê撇步，一雙手比手畫刀做表演：「Ài kā牛奶矸仔ián-khi-khi，輕輕仔hiù，kā uì奶喙仔hiù--出-來ê牛奶，滴hē手肚，手肚若感覺bē siunn燒ê溫度，án-ne就適合嬰仔suh--ah！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">查埔人聽我講煞，趁樣緊kā牛奶矸仔ê牛奶，hiù滴踮伊家己ê手肚，了後，笑笑向我tàm頭行一个禮，sueh一句多謝！牛奶矸仔mooh--leh，隨koh翻頭行tuì lim水機hia去。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab